    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are privileged to present 69 Castletown Manor, a stunning A-rated feature residence to the market. This spacious 4 bedroom house was completed in 2023 and provides a unique opportunity to acquire an A-rated home in excellent walk-in condition. 69 Castletown Manor occupies a prominent position on a quiet cul de sac and overlooks a large green area. Located in this desirable estate, houses of this nature rarely come to the market. \r\n\r\nThe property has been tastefully decorated to a superb standard by the current owners and benefits from a low maintenance professionally landscaped rear garden. Extending to 185 square meters the accommodation features an entrance hall, two separate living rooms, a bright open plan kitchen/dining area, laundry room and a guest WC on the ground floor. The first floor consists of four spacious double bedrooms including a master ensuite, storage closet and main bathroom.\r\n\r\nA real feature of this home is the feature Georgian style exterior finish with a cobble lock driveway to the front and a spacious contemporary designed back garden. This home has a high level of energy efficiency with a BER rating of A2 achieved by using a combination of high-performance building materials and efficient heating equipment. \r\n\r\nResidents of Castletown Manor benefit from its convenient location within walking distance to a host of amenities including O ’Growney National School, Athboy Community School, shops, Pharmacy, and public transport links."
      },
      {
